{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/5\u670821\u65e5.gif?t=1750374452\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite map with day-night cycles (currently 1 map with 5 types of monster in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep weapon combination system (currently 28 weapons in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and powerful artifacts (currently 28 artifacts in Early Access)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Update v0.2 will be available on Jun 20. Please check update details in events and announcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/v0.2_update.png?t=1750374452\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738660?t=1750374452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738660?t=1750374452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/b1b2284dbc9c6104eb3dc5406fa233b74909dd99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750374452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/b1b2284dbc9c6104eb3dc5406fa233b74909dd99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750374452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","i